~ start

Solius: [[Hi|Hello|Howdy]], this is some dialogue.
if GameData.has_spoken_to(GameData.speaking_to)
	Me: NOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOO
else:
	Solius: Here are some choices.
	- First one
		Solius: You picked the first one.
	- Second one
		Solius: You picked the second one.
	- Start again => start
	- End the conversation => END
	Solius: For more information see the online documentation.
	set GameData.add_spoken_to("Solius")

=> END